      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## ACE-Step 1.5 cover mode (audio reference)\n\nThe **Reference Audio** node (`ReferenceTimbreAudio`) switches ACE-Step 1.5 into **cover mode**: the output follows the reference's arrangement, rhythm and energy curve, while the tags and the structure text decide instrumentation and style.\n\n**Before you run**\n\n- Upload a reference in **Step 4**. Use audio you have the rights to.\n- Make the reference at least as long as *Song Duration*; after its end the model gets silence.\n- Set **bpm** to the reference's tempo.\n- Keep **generate_audio_codes** off. In this mode `cfg_scale`, `temperature`, `top_p`, `top_k` and `min_p` only drive the audio-code LM, which is skipped, so they have no effect.\n- Turbo model: KSampler steps 8, cfg 1.\n\n**Model**\n\n- [ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/checkpoints/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors) → `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/`\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
