      "widgets_values": [
        "Berlin techno, acid techno, distorted TR-909 kick, aggressive TB-303 acid basslines, high-resonance squelch, industrial percussion, metallic textures, dark warehouse atmosphere, relentless energy, hypnotic modular synths, driving and gritty, instrumental, no vocals",
        "[Intro] 16s\n[distorted 909 kick, sharp closed hi-hats, industrial noise floor]\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Verse 1] 32s\n[aggressive TB-303 acid sequence starts, resonant filter chirps, driving industrial percussion]\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Bridge] 16s\n[high-resonance 303 sweeps, metallic synth stabs, building white noise tension, rapid snare rolls]\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Chorus] 32s\n[full intensity, pounding distorted kick, multiple overlapping acid lines, rhythmic claps, dark warehouse atmosphere]\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Breakdown] 16s\n[drums drop out, oscillating resonant 303 squelch, dark modular drones, cold reverb]\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Chorus] 32s\n[relentless return of the beat, heavy 909 sub-bass, screaming acid leads, high-pass filter modulations]\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Outro] 24s\n[stripping back to heavy kick and industrial hats, fading acid filter, final resonant echo]\n[Instrumental]",
